<7B1B>				clearLampgroupsAltbuf Bitgroup#03|$40 Bitgroup#03 
<7B1E>				rotRightBitgroups Bitgroup#02 
<7B20>				rotRightBitgroups Bitgroup#03 
<7B22>			_EndUnless
<7B22>	status_report:															; status report startup
<7B22>			setThreadFlags Thread#50 
